       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "osmotic symptoms"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " appear (polyuria, polydipsia, weight loss), but without the ketoacidosis of DKA or the marked hyperosmolar dehydration of HHS. Either DKA or HHS should prompt a search for a "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "precipitating factor."
     }
    ]
